From e20b8b473ced37e1c4c71f27f85bf3f04917dbcf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Price <thesamprice@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:25:41 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] testsuite: ask for .loc in the hierarchical discriminator
 tests

The hierarchical-discriminator tests look for "discriminator N" in .loc
directives, on gas targets.  A target can use gas and still have gcc
write the line table itself (DWARF2_ASM_LINE_DEBUG_INFO 0, as on
MicroBlaze); the discriminators are then in the table but the scans
find nothing, and all seven fail.  Pass -gas-loc-support, the option
that DWARF2_ASM_LINE_DEBUG_INFO only sets the default of, on gas
targets.

Assisted-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>

gcc/testsuite/ChangeLog:

	* gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-ch.c: Add -gas-loc-support
	for gas targets.
	* gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-loop-version.c: Likewise.
	* gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-rtl-unroll.c: Likewise.
	* gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-tracer.c: Likewise.
	* gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-unroll-jam.c: Likewise.
	* gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-unroll.c: Likewise.
	* gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-unswitch.c: Likewise.
---
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-ch.c           | 1 +
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-loop-version.c | 1 +
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-rtl-unroll.c   | 1 +
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-tracer.c       | 1 +
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-unroll-jam.c   | 1 +
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-unroll.c       | 1 +
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.dg/hierarchical-discriminator-unswitch.c     | 1 +
 7 files changed, 7 insertions(+)

